//     'inverse' variant (uses CIPH_K^-1 in W) is NOT implemented in kw.js
//     (P3 limitation, documented).
//   - 18 encrypt groups + 18 decrypt groups per suite (AES-128/192/256 x
//     6 payloadLen values). Sub-sample [first, middle, last] per group =>
//     3 vectors / group.
//   - KW  : payloadLen in {128, 576, 1152, 3456, 3904, 4096} bits
